OL,3,AResults due at national giant veg
OL,4,Acompetition as farmers describe
OL,5,Apressure after 'brutal' summer
OL,6,
OL,7,FBritain's biggest vegetables are being
OL,8,Fjudged at the National Giant Vegetables
OL,9,FChampionship in Malvern - here's how
OL,10,Fthey're weighed
OL,12,FFrom the heaviest aubergine to the
OL,13,Flongest runner bean, 169 growers are
OL,14,Fcompeting across 33 categories
OL,16,FThis year's competition comes after the
OL,17,FUK's hottest summer on record, with
OL,18,Ffarmers telling our reporter how a
OL,19,F"brutal" few months has left them
OL,20,F"really feeling the financial pressure"
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
