OL,3,AResults due at national giant veg
OL,4,Acompetition as farmers describe
OL,5,Apressure after 'brutal' summer
OL,6,
OL,7,FDerek Hulme, a hopeful grower at the
OL,8,Fchampionship, says this summer's
OL,9,Fheatwaves have "played havoc" with his
OL,10,Fveg. Another, Tim Saint, tells us he
OL,11,Fwas tending to his giant pumpkin at
OL,12,F05:30 BST before work and well into the
OL,13,Fevening
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
